<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian Stocks to Watch Today - May 19.</title>
<headline>Australian Stocks to Watch Today - May 19.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some Australian stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>*Burns Philp &amp; Co Ltd A$1.85 (-0.14)</p>
<p>Trading in Burns Philp shares was halted pending an announcement.</p>
<p>* Colonial Ltd</p>
<p>Colonial Ltd is expected to list at 11.00 a.m. (0100 GMT) at a premium to the A$3.10 set for institutional investors on Sunday.</p>
<p>* National Australia Bank Ltd A$17.95 (-0.16)</p>
<p>NAB Managing Director Don Argus said on Sunday he was worried about being taken over by a large foreign bank.</p>
<p>* Coles Myer Ltd A$6.16 (-0.04)</p>
<p>* David Jones Ltd A$1.63 (unch)</p>
<p>* Country Road Ltd A$1.70 (unch)</p>
<p>Sharply colder weather in major cities in the last week is expected to finally kick start buying of the department stores' new ranges of winter season clothes.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
